l_appeals_count": 507, "received_works": [{"path": "/@alnath_may/works/88", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1942535, "client_id": 2609965, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c839046b/uploads/origins/89edd99d-5c11-4f73-a623-820ea7420a29?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=11423cf18607dd19cbab51cc08879269", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c839046b/uploads/origins/89edd99d-5c11-4f73-a623-820ea7420a29?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5ddecdff15197f0d0592a08205cc7d1c", "src_set": ""}, "body": "レヴェリーが影を使って悪ふざけをしたり、注目されたいと思っている絵のアイデアが大好きだ。\n\n参考までに：\nhttps://f2.toyhou.se/file/f2-toyhou-se/images/74988706_7T8f0L1mmLJIq5g.png\nhttps://f2.toyhou.se/file/f2-toyhou-se/images/100179057_BKQxxnpHho6urmV.png\n\nご検討ありがとうございました！\n\nhttps://f2.toyhou.se/file/f2-toyhou-se/images/97538159_BKMLgOkYlMjzKGJ.png\n\nhttps://f2.toyhou.se/file/f2-toyhou-se/images/97538159_BKMLgOkYlMjzKGJ.png", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@alnath_may/works/87", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1942535, "client_id": 3036265, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/83c09e7a/uploads/origins/1b199329-f62a-4a09-97f5-e93820eeb621?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5b4b60b047a393342bd2356bd8abe024", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/83c09e7a/uploads/origins/1b199329-f62a-4a09-97f5-e93820eeb621?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9efd2d72566e19bb98daffc105073e25", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！\n\nあなたのアピールを見て、ぜひメープルの依頼をしたいと思いました！\n\nポーズ、衣装、表情など全てお任せします！かわいく仕上げてください！背景はバナーや壁紙に使えると嬉しいです！\n\nありがとうございました。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1h6FYoXw7mq0ggFQG0sifRPg1wdx9ZsOT?usp=drive_link", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@alnath_may/works/86", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a93ba3aa/uploads/origins/bac29690-2f43-46d5-a5e9-50918b06cffa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=d5f9d537671ce7efefd1f73d3f68b644", "src_set": ""}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1942535, "client_id": 975494, "vtt_url": "", "thumbnail_image_urls": null, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "body": "", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@alnath_may/works/85", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1942535, "client_id": 3342774, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e1f9def6/uploads/origins/dee1feb6-b1fa-4a78-984d-7f7513b12ab6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bc9f13f5561707d9573110ff3ce00503", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e1f9def6/uploads/origins/dee1feb6-b1fa-4a78-984d-7f7513b12ab6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5b2022ac99628ddc32cb61909ea8704b", "src_set": ""}, "body": "多々良先生、こんにちは！\n\n先生の作品が大好きです！バーチャル疫病医Vtuberのアイミーです！\n\n私はシャドウ・ザ・ヘッジホッグの大ファンなので、ソニックレーシングクロスワールドのレースクイーンの服を着ている私を描いてほしいです。\n\n衣装\n - 色赤、黒、白\n- 衣装参考衣装と同様\n\nポーズ\n- 参考ポーズと同じ\n\n表情\n- 遊び心と喜び\n\nキャラクターリファレンス\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1igSw0TeKt5E1U8bCLYAbi7-04Jz323te?usp=drive_link\n\n衣装とポーズの参考\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1FYu7YwNkcvdQ7UCBcI67X6yYld2s_7PX?usp=drive_link\n\nできれば横長の構図が望ましいです。キャラクターと背景を分離したPSDまたはPNGをいただけると助かります。\n\nSNSへの投稿、youtube動画への使用は可能な範囲でお願いします。\n\nご検討のほど、よろしくお願いいたします！\nそれでは、良い一日を！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1FYu7YwNkcvdQ7UCBcI67X6yYld2s_7PX?usp=drive_link", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@alnath_may/works/84", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1942535, "client_id": 3432294, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e4eada21/uploads/origins/400e8fb0-7383-4d57-a8eb-f6fa0affec38?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ba135ad7c711cc44c12e677f570410e6", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/e4eada21/uploads/origins/400e8fb0-7383-4d57-a8eb-f6fa0affec38?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=77b39fb1e9b09b56f45718d12372056f", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは、tataraさん！私のモデルに気に入ってくれてありがとう！！\n君のイラストはすごく可愛くて、ちょっぴりエロくてきれいです！よろしければ、マンタを書いてください！！\n\nコントローラーを持ってる提案はいいですね！私もよくプレイステーションのコントローラーを使ってる！\nもちろんあんまり負けませんけど、その表情も面白い！勝つや負け、好きに選んでください！\nよろしくおねがいします！　へ(・ω・ へ)╭╯\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1KAFq9zqbXOXbC_bvRBzYY-14GZmpA4KZ?usp=drive_link", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@alnath_may/works/83", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1942535, "client_id": 2894959, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b7a6c090/uploads/origins/a295f19c-82c6-4190-8f9c-e22d793b0c09?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bf7881ec0a8b5ed313002a0317b1f49d", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/b7a6c090/uploads/origins/a295f19c-82c6-4190-8f9c-e22d793b0c09?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b57f0022cafc4c056ecdd811816e6959", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Hi Tatara! Thank you so much for the appeal and your kind comments - they made me super happy! Your style is super soft, cute, and expressive - I love it! I would love to request am illustration of my vtuber. \n\nVidia is a fairy from space who is playful, flirty, and mischievous! She gets excited easily, likes to explore, and gets flustered over pretty people. I'll leave the posing and idea up to you! Have fun with it! \n\nI would like to use this artwork in SNS such as Twitter, Twitch and Youtube!\nIt may be used in the future in Thumbnails and other livestreams so I would be happy if you included separated layers.\n\nYou can choose to have her jacket on or off with her wings up or down. Her mascot is the Nottie if you choose to include them! They are a slime-like creature.   \nReference: \nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1m1jLRNsePTvcKFKkR1Jzka2uFsa6wGV1?usp=sharing\n\nThank you for your consideration!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1m1jLRNsePTvcKFKkR1Jzka2uFsa6wGV1?usp=sharing", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@alnath_may/works/82", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1942535, "client_id": 734553, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/351f4633/uploads/origins/95c28eaf-4f97-4eea-8638-f2103edbd641?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7fced3deff4e71c93b1f144fbd6de0f9", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/351f4633/uploads/origins/95c28eaf-4f97-4eea-8638-f2103edbd641?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=133e386119a6d83218d8fbd6866beabb", "src_set": ""}, "body": "こんにちは！アピールありがとうございます！私のキャラクターを描いてほしいです！\n\n彼女は日焼けした肌の狐の女の子で、頭にはスライムがあり、尻尾を覆っている。スライムは魔法で、いろいろな物や形を作ることができ、望めばもっと作ることができます。普段はクールに描かれているが、すぐに照れてしまう。\n\nぜひ好きなように描いていただきたいです！よろしくお願いします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1eTG5UOn0QEcpLyvgbHj3isFf8OXzyA-B", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@alnath_may/works/81", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1942535, "client_id": 3181093, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/664459f0/uploads/origins/4162ddc9-6093-4a62-9b8f-ad15e9231bd3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=69e5c57d3f9f3754e4e738c39e93f146", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/664459f0/uploads/origins/4162ddc9-6093-4a62-9b8f-ad15e9231bd3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=173d063f51d3de4b2efaae821c698c85", "src_set": ""}, "body": "アピールをありがとう！\nぜひ私のキャラクターを描いていただきたいです！\n\n私のVtuber水美は、とある事件で神聖な吸血鬼の血を引く悪魔で、可愛い宝石が大好きな王族です。いたずら好きで、契約しているコンパニオンのミミック魔導書に何でもやってもらっています！右の角にリボン、牙、胸と目の下のほくろ、大きな胸、長い赤い爪、翼が特徴。\n\nアピールと一緒に送られてきたアイデアが好きなので、好きなものを選んでください！私のキャラクターを描くことを楽しんでほしい！\n\nクレジットは必ずお渡しします！\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1uNyyxKDqpMp2sFEFEkfZufA5n9Q2LrOM?usp=sharing", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@alnath_may/works/80", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 1942535, "client_id": 3459931, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/cd4124b9/uploads/origins/c5a2cee4-83a7-43ca